THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The MIT licence above covers the original work in this repository: the
reinforcement-learning environment and training code (`clean_version/`), the
MPC safety filter, the shielded ROS controller, the `myboat_description` and
`myboat_gazebo` packages, and the figures under `media/`.

The simulation assets and Gazebo plugins vendored under `src/vrx_gazebo/`,
`src/wave_gazebo/`, `src/wave_gazebo_plugins/`, `src/usv_gazebo_plugins/` and
`src/usv_msgs/` are derived from the Virtual RobotX (VRX) project,
https://github.com/osrf/vrx, and remain licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
Those files keep their original copyright and licence headers; the terms of
Apache 2.0 apply to them rather than the MIT terms above.
